 "@id": "fylite:app/case/evolve-iter-15ma-benchmark",
 "@type": "fylite:AppSession/1",
 "fylite:page": "evolve",
 "fylite:case": {
  "fylite:name": "ITER 15 MA 对标（要先导入两份参考件）",
  "fylite:name_en": "ITER 15 MA benchmark (import two reference files first)",
  "fylite:needs": [
   "一张参考平衡 g 文件（15 MA 感应燃烧），用「导入」喂进来 —— 几何来源随之切到「导入的 g 文件」",
   "一份参考剖面 CSV（列名含 rho / TE / TI / NE / q，如某系统码的输出表）—— 虚线叠加并逐道报相对差"
  ],
  "fylite:needs_en": [
   "A reference equilibrium g-file (15 MA inductive burn), fed through Import -- the geometry source follows it",
   "A reference profile CSV (columns rho / TE / TI / NE / q, e.g. a systems code's output table) -- overlaid dashed, with the per-channel deviation reported"
  ],
  "fylite:note": "★这一档**本身跑不起来**，要等两份参考件：装置与实验数据不入本仓（这是仓规），所以算例只带得动控件，带不动数据。导入之后按计算键即可。★勾着「以参考剖面为初值 / 规定密度」：推进**从参考剖面出发**、密度按它规定、边界取它自己的末点——这时读数里的相对差量的就是「这套输运模型让剖面漂了多远」，也就是复现检验本身，而不是一次拟合。★χ₀ = 0.6 m²/s 是**对标定出来的**单值有效扩散率，不取自任何标度律；1.0 / 0.6 / 0.35 三档的均方根差是 6.7 % / 2.7 % / 5.0 %。",
  "fylite:note_en": "★This case **cannot run on its own**: it waits for two reference files. Device and experimental data stay out of this repository by rule, so a case can carry controls and not data. Import them, then press the key. ★'Start from the reference profiles / prescribe its density' is ticked: the march then STARTS on the published profiles with the published density held and the boundary taken from its own last point, so the deviation in the readings measures how far this transport model drifts from them -- the reproduction test itself, not a fit. ★chi0 = 0.6 m^2/s is a single effective diffusivity FOUND BY THAT COMPARISON, not taken from any scaling law; at 1.0 / 0.6 / 0.35 the r.m.s. deviations are 6.7 % / 2.7 % / 5.0 %."
 },
